		line=537,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"After I drop Akari off, I head straight for the Sworn Blades headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Yogarasu District is a hive of activity in the dead of night.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"The densely packed stalls sell everything from Republican Army supplies procured by questionable means, to outright fenced goods.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Due to the nature of their wares, their customers naturally avoid the light of day.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"That is why the district takes its name after magpies in the night.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Choking on the stench of oily cooking and stuffy body heat, I slip into the general store where our headquarters' entrance is located.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Many warriors have gathered at the headquarters to hear the results of the operation.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"The more hot-headed warriors of the Maki faction have already started toasting in celebration.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Honestly, what an undisciplined bunch.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"One of the three tenets of all warriors is, “Temper always your body and mind.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"This precept does not just mean to train in the blade arts every day.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Its true meaning is to keep yourself in peak physical and mental condition, ready to serve your lord at any time.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"To inebriate oneself should be out of the question.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"It is only when you are prepared to serve at every moment that you can uphold the first tenet, “Show absolute fealty to your lord.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"In contrast to Maki's faction and its lax observance of rules,\nHotori's faction steadfastly upholds the three tenets.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Rather than getting worked up over the operation's success, they patiently await Hotori's address.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We will now commence with the mission report.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We recovered a total of twenty-seven spellblades, among which one was a keenblade.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“However, approximately half, including the keenblade, are severely damaged and require Honing before being combat-ready.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Our side suffered no casualties.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A first response team arrived on the scene eight minutes after our operation concluded. Their investigation is still ongoing.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As of now, there is no indication that the attack will be traced back to us.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Furthermore, I will add that the Exalt-Priestess was found aboard one of the transports, and that I took her into my custody.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“According to the Exalt-Priestess, she was asked to Hone the spellblades.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This ends my report.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"The headquarters is abuzz at my mention of having secured the Exalt-Priestess.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Order!”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"The room falls silent at Hotori's command.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Despite the sudden change of plans at the last minute, I am very pleased with the outcome of the operation.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“To all those who heeded my emergency summons and carried out your mission, you have my sincere gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Worthy of special recognition, our operative Koyuzu.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Yes ma'am.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Koyuzu straightens her posture.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This operation wouldn't have been possible without the intelligence you provided. You've rendered a great service.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Your praise honors me.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“House Ina has served as agents of espionage for many generations.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I shall continue to work diligently as not to besmirch my\nancestors' name.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Koyuzu declares as she offers Hotori a deep bow.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hey, Inago, not half bad.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“My name is not Inago. It's Ina Koyuzu!”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Heh, just what an Inago would say.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Are you mocking me?!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Kazuma brushes off Koyuzu's yappering with a laugh.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Say, acting chairman, this success has brought our day of reckoning real close, hasn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It is as you say.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Let us continue to lay the groundwork for the day we rise up.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Hotori turns and addresses the entire room.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Oh, boy... You've seriously got too much restraint for your own damn good.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's exactly why my vice chairman is someone as daring as you are.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The Blades are at their best when we meet in the middle.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm counting on you.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Hotori deftly parries Kazuma's retort.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Just as Tokita mentioned in his report, the Republican Army has enlisted the Exalt-Priestess's help with Honing.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It would appear that they've begun to show an interest in spellblades and magicks in general.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I ask that you also expand your intel-gathering to include information regarding this development.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Everyone nods in assent.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Now then, Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yes.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As you reported, half of the spellblades we've recovered are in need of Honing.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Would it be possible to request the Exalt-Priestess's services?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I will try. Please give me some time.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I leave it in your hands.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Now, regarding our next spellblade recovery operation, I have a proposal.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Oh, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"now",
{"/font"},
" we're talkin'...”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Our target will be a military warehouse on the outskirts of Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Hotori's declaration sends a wave of murmurs throughout the headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Naturally, a military warehouse is bound to have very tight security.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Under regular circumstances, such a raid would have a rather low chance of success.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“However, what if we were to strike at the same time as the Armistice Day ceremony?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I see. On that day, security forces will be concentrated in the Republican occupation zone.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I like it. We'll get 'em while their defenses are spread thin.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Based on our investigations from last year, this plan seems to be viable.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“There's no guarantee that their security protocols will be the same as last year, but it's well worth a shot.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"No objections are raised.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“In that case, the details will be decided at a later war council.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"This declaration is met with cheers.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"The daring proposal has put many of Maki's hot-blooded subordinates in high spirits.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I won't instruct you not to drink tonight, but never forget that success often begets carelessness. Keep your wits about you.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You are dismissed.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"At Hotori's words, everyone straightens up and faces the altar.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Time for the usual Ringing ritual.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"We all bow in unison and slightly unsheathe our wakizashi.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“With Oomikami as our witness, we of the Sworn Blades solemnly affirm our steel-firm solidarity and pledge allegiance to Her Imperial Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Any who would break this oath must by rights offer their life in atonement.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“For allegiance.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“For allegiance.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"We all receive a bonus from Hotori for services rendered, and the members begin to stream out of the headquarters in high spirits.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Say, Tokita, how about a drink for once?”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You know full well that I don't drink.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You never change, do you? Whatever, keep yourself tempered...”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“But if you ask me, anyone who'd lose after a few drinks'd lose even if they were dead sober.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Maki snorts at me and leaves the headquarters with his comrades in tow.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"I'm soon left alone with Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, why'd you bring Miyaguni with you today?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Hotori approaches me with narrowed eyes.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It was an emergency. I had no choice.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you think I wanted to bring her along?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yes.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What do you take me for?”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Miyaguni's servant.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That is correct.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haah... I'm so done...”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Hotori mutters deflatedly.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That said, right now I am only serving her bloodline.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She's still too immature for me to offer her fealty from the bottom of my heart.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I don't get that at all.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If your lord really is immature, I think true fealty would be to unconditionally stand by them.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Perhaps that's right for House Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"The house at the forefront of warrior society must set a good example by always showing steadfast devotion to its lord.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"In Hotori's eyes, I must seem disloyal for passing judgment on my own lord.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Either way, we're both heading down the wrong path,\naren't we?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Only if you keep Empress Hisui as your lord to the very end.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“When you put it that straight, I can't even be bothered to get angry.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, how did it come to this?”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I swear I will prove Akari's lineage, for both of our sakes as well.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's troubling in and of itself... Ahh, now you've got me anxious!”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"We speak lightly, but we are both dead serious.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"To choose a lord means choosing the person to whom you offer your very life.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Should Hotori try to bring harm upon Akari, I would have no choice but to strike her down.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"The opposite would be just as true.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"The way of the warrior is to prioritize your fealty over even feelings of filiality or love.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Of course, I would wish to avoid fighting Hotori if at all possible.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"That's why it's so important to be able to prove Akari's lineage.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"For my own sake, for Akari's, but also for Hotori's.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
